# Licensing

Dark Egg Research first-party source and documentation are licensed under the
GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or any later version:

    AGPL-3.0-or-later

The complete license is in LICENSE.

## Scope

The license covers original material in this repository. It does not relicense:

- cited papers;
- quotations;
- third-party dependencies;
- sibling repositories;
- externally produced test vectors;
- imported or generated artifacts whose manifests say otherwise.

No legacy implementation code has been imported into this repository.

## Contributions

Unless an accepted contribution explicitly states otherwise, contributions are
submitted under AGPL-3.0-or-later and the contributor represents that they have
the right to submit them. A public collaboration process should use
Signed-off-by trailers or an equivalent Developer Certificate of Origin record.

## Artifact movement

An artifact crossing into or out of this repository requires:

- source repository and immutable commit;
- exact source paths;
- license and copyright;
- third-party derivation;
- generator command;
- canonical bytes and SHA-256;
- receiver checks.

License compatibility does not replace provenance.


